        "# SDXL Base 1.0 — 9:16 HD (768×1344 native → ~1097×1920 via latent upscale)\n\n📺 Install video #2: [Install SDXL ComfyUI](https://github.com/comfyworkflow/comfy-workflow#install-sdxl-pending)\n🔬 Benchmark Pillar #1: [Pillar #1](https://github.com/comfyworkflow/comfy-workflow#video-pillar-1-pending)\n\n📥 Install: [https://github.com/comfyworkflow/comfy-workflow/tree/main/setup-windows](https://github.com/comfyworkflow/comfy-workflow/tree/main/setup-windows)\n- `install-sdxl.bat`\n\n⚙️ Config:\n- Resolution: 768×1344 native → ~1097×1919 after latent upscale\n- Sampler: `dpmpp_2m` / `karras`\n- 25 steps · CFG 7.0\n- Refiner: 15 steps, denoise 0.45, `nearest-exact` upscale\n\n📐 Outras aspect ratios neste install:\n- `sdxl_base.json` — 1:1 square (1024×1024 native)\n- `sdxl_base_landscape.json` — 16:9 landscape (1344×768 native bucket)\n- `sdxl_base_portrait.json` — 9:16 portrait (768×1344 native bucket)\n- `sdxl_base_landscape_hd.json` — 16:9 HD (1344×768 native → ~1920×1097 via latent upscale)\n\n💾 Hardware mínimo: 16 GB RAM · 8 GB VRAM"
